---
const workflows = [
  {
    title: "Component-maintenance workflow",
    unit: "Seconds per outcome",
    scaleMax: 90,
    ticks: [0, 30, 60, 90],
    rows: [
      {
        label: "Manual baseline (model rate)",
        value: "90.0 s",
        widthPct: 100,
        variant: "manual",
      },
      {
        label: "Initial automated loop (median, p90 8.0 s)",
        value: "6.0 s",
        widthPct: (6 / 90) * 100,
        variant: "automated",
      },
    ],
  },
  {
    title: "Material-update workflow",
    unit: "Seconds per record save",
    scaleMax: 108,
    ticks: [0, 36, 72, 108],
    rows: [
      {
        label: "Manual baseline (timed example to estimate)",
        value: "38.6–108.0 s",
        widthPct: 100,
        minPct: (38.6 / 108) * 100,
        variant: "manual-range",
      },
      {
        label: "Initial automated loop (138-row baseline)",
        value: "17.5 s",
        widthPct: (17.5 / 108) * 100,
        variant: "automated",
      },
    ],
  },
];
---

<figure
  class="automaton-baseline not-prose"
  aria-labelledby="automaton-baseline-title automaton-baseline-caption"
>
  <div class="baseline-heading">
    <h3 id="automaton-baseline-title" class="font-display">
      Foundational baseline: manual effort vs. first automated loop
    </h3>
    <p class="baseline-context">
      Per-record execution time before wait optimization or multi-worker
      scaling, comparing manual SAP edits with the initial single-browser
      driver.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="baseline-grid">
    {
      workflows.map((workflow) => (
        <div class="baseline-card">
          <h4 class="font-display">{workflow.title}</h4>
          <p class="baseline-unit">{workflow.unit}</p>
          <dl class="baseline-series">
            {workflow.rows.map((row) => (
              <div class="baseline-row">
                <dt>{row.label}</dt>
                <dd>
                  <span class="baseline-value font-display">{row.value}</span>
                  <span class="baseline-track" aria-hidden="true">
                    {row.variant === "manual-range" ? (
                      <>
                        <span
                          class="baseline-bar baseline-manual-low"
                          style={`width: ${row.minPct}%`}
                        />
                        <span
                          class="baseline-bar baseline-manual-band"
                          style={`left: ${row.minPct}%; width: ${100 - (row.minPct ?? 0)}%`}
                        />
                      </>
                    ) : (
                      <span
                        class={`baseline-bar baseline-${row.variant}`}
                        style={`width: ${row.widthPct}%`}
                      />
                    )}
                  </span>
                </dd>
              </div>
            ))}
          </dl>
          <div class="baseline-axis font-display" aria-hidden="true">
            {workflow.ticks.map((tick) => (
              <span>{tick}s</span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </div>

  <figcaption id="automaton-baseline-caption">
    Manual rates come from the project's cost-savings model (90 s per component
    outcome; 38.6–108 s per material save, where the shaded band spans the
    38.6–108.0 s estimate range). Initial automated timings come from early
    single-browser run-journal cohorts (2,892 component outcomes through May 22,
    2026; 138-row single-field material baseline on June 18, 2026).
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .automaton-baseline {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);
    border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: #fff;
    color: #0f172a;
  }
  .baseline-heading h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .baseline-context {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
    color: #475569;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .baseline-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.75rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
  .baseline-card {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .baseline-card h4 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.825rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .baseline-unit {
    margin: 0.2rem 0 1.1rem;
    color: #475569;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .baseline-series {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .baseline-row {
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .baseline-row + .baseline-row {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  .baseline-row dt {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .baseline-row dd {
    margin: 0;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .baseline-value {
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .baseline-track {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 1.1rem;
    border-left: 1px solid #94a3b8;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0,
      transparent calc(33.333% - 1px),
      #e2e8f0 calc(33.333% - 1px),
      #e2e8f0 33.333%
    );
  }
  .baseline-bar {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    display: block;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .baseline-manual,
  .baseline-manual-low {
    background: #64748b;
  }
  .baseline-manual-band {
    background: rgba(100, 116, 139, 0.45);
    border-right: 2px dashed #64748b;
  }
  .baseline-automated {
    background: #166534;
  }
  .baseline-axis {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 0.45rem;
    color: #475569;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .automaton-baseline figcaption {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    color: #475569;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  :global(.dark) .automaton-baseline {
    background: #111c2e;
    border-color: #334155;
    color: #f8fafc;
  }
  :global(.dark) .baseline-context,
  :global(.dark) .baseline-unit,
  :global(.dark) .baseline-axis,
  :global(.dark) .automaton-baseline figcaption {
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }
  :global(.dark) .baseline-track {
    border-color: #64748b;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0,
      transparent calc(33.333% - 1px),
      #1e293b calc(33.333% - 1px),
      #1e293b 33.333%
    );
  }
  :global(.dark) .baseline-manual,
  :global(.dark) .baseline-manual-low {
    background: #94a3b8;
  }
  :global(.dark) .baseline-manual-band {
    background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.35);
    border-right-color: #cbd5e1;
  }
  :global(.dark) .baseline-automated {
    background: #b6e5d3;
  }
  :global(.dark) .automaton-baseline figcaption {
    border-color: #334155;
  }
  @media (max-width: 639px) {
    .baseline-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .baseline-card + .baseline-card {
      border-top: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      padding-top: 1.25rem;
    }
    :global(.dark) .baseline-card + .baseline-card {
      border-color: #334155;
    }
  }
</style>
